# Adventure — Narrow-Phone Containment Proof

The Awtsmoos fits direction, decision, and play into one narrow vessel without spill;
Awtsmoos.com now keeps the whole Adventure world inside the phone while every thumb target remains deliberate and still.

## Original defect

At requested 320×568 the visual viewport and document client width were 320px, but document scroll width became 352px. Live geometry proved the control footer was the source: 184px D-pad + 10px gap + 150px actions = 344px inside a 304px content vessel, forcing the entire app grid wider.

## Isolated implementation

The Adventure tree is under concurrent development, so existing D-pad/action/gameplay files were preserved. Only the tiny control import manifest was rewritten and a late `styles/controls/narrow-polish.css` module was added.

At <=360px:
- D-pad cells become 44×44px.
- D-pad gap becomes 4px and padding 6px, yielding a 154px total D-pad.
- Action column becomes 140px.
- Control gap remains 10px.
- 154 + 10 + 140 = 304px, exactly matching the content vessel.
- HUD brand text is allowed to shrink/ellipsis rather than become a second min-content width source.
- Action/overlay restart controls gain pressed feedback plus fine-pointer hover and reduced-motion neutralization.

## Final runtime evidence on healthy HTTP server

390×844:
- document clientWidth: 390;
- document scrollWidth: 390;
- horizontal overflow: 0;
- HUD/canvas/objective/control right edge: x=382 inside viewport;
- overlay card: x=32..358;
- no off-screen action control;
- runtime exceptions: none.

320×568:
- document clientWidth: 320;
- document scrollWidth: 320;
- horizontal overflow: 0;
- HUD/canvas/objective/control right edge: x=312 inside viewport;
- control row: exactly 304px wide;
- D-pad: 154×154;
- action column: 140×104;
- D-pad action cells: exactly 44×44;
- Pause/Restart: 140×48;
- overlay card: x=32..288;
- no off-screen or sub-44px critical action control;
- runtime exceptions: none.

The earlier repeated readiness failures were not product defects: the previous port 8902 server was half-alive and returned a socket hang-up. Fresh server 8903 returned HTTP 200 and produced the successful measurement above.

## Source hygiene

- `controls.css` remains a tiny readable import manifest.
- `narrow-polish.css` is 71 lines.
- The one overlong manifest comment caught by the first static gate was rewritten across readable lines without changing behavior.

## NEXT_ACTION

Audit the shared game player-shell because it appears across many games. Verify its launcher and open menu at 390/320, then complete hover/active/focus semantics only if current source proves a shared gap.
